# Cursor rules

Backend: Laravel 13 JSON API (Sail). Frontend: Vue 3 SPA in /frontend. No Blade, no routes/web.php. Auth: Sanctum Bearer tokens.

Ollama in Docker: nomic-embed-text (RAG), qwen3:8b (storyteller copilot). Storyteller copilot: 3 NPC draft replies, post with npc_name.

**Documentation:** canonical narrative docs in `docs/` (Obsidian vault). Update relevant `docs/` notes when changing behavior, API, setup, or architecture. See `docs/Home.md`.

Coding conventions: `.cursor/rules/` (stack.mdc, project-map.mdc, docs-obsidian.mdc always apply; laravel-api, vue-frontend, ai-rag by glob).
